<title>UK: Lehman sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>Lehman sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance S.A has issued 35 million American-style call and put warrants, in seven equal tranches, on Deutsche Telekom, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   02.DEC.96	MIN EXER LOT   100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  32 DEM	   LISTING  FFURT, STUTT, DUSS</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE		MATURITY  STRIKE  PRICE    PREMIUM   GEARING</p>
<p> SPRINTER CALL 1 18.JUL.97 31 DEM  2.80 DEM 5.62 PCT  11.42 X</p>
<p> SPRINTER CALL 2 18.JUL.97 33 DEM  1.75 DEM 8.59 PCT  18.28 X</p>
<p> SPRINTER CALL 3 18.JUL.97 35 DEM  1.05 DEM 12.65 PCT 30.47 X</p>
<p> SPRINTER CALL 4 18.JUL.97 37 DEM  0.60 DEM 17.50 PCT 53.33 X</p>
<p> SPRINTER CALL 5 30.JUL.99 40 DEM  1.90 DEM 30.93 PCT 16.84 X</p>
<p> HEDGE PUT 1     30.DEC.97 33 DEM  3.35 DEM 7.34 PCT  9.55 X</p>
<p> HEDGE PUT 2     30.DEC.97 35 DEM  4.60 DEM 5.00 PCT  6.95 X</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
